S: Henry Playford "The Dancing Master", 9th edition (1695)
N: 17th. century as "The Red House". Later renamed "Where would bonnie Annie lie?"
N: from words of Allan Ramsey's song, 1724. in RSCDS from Walsh's Country Dances 1731.
N: 48-bar reel in Playford; this is the 40-bar version for the modern Scottish dance.
